NAME
	recon - reconnaissance and information gathering module.

DESCRIPTION
	Perform reconnaissance on a target domain or IP. The module gathers
	subdomain, DNS, and open-source infrastructure information using theHarvester.
	When theHarvester is not installed, it automatically falls back to native
	DNS query resolution (A, CNAME) and reverse IP lookups.

UNDERLYING TOOL
	theHarvester (with native Python DNS fallback)

EXECUTION
	theHarvester -d <target> -b all
	(Fallback: native socket.getaddrinfo / nslookup)

USAGE
	use recon

MODULE OPTION
	target - target domain or IP.

COMMANDS
	show modules
		Display available modules.

	set target <domain>
		Define the target domain or IP.

	run
		Execute the reconnaissance module.

EXAMPLE
	use recon
	set target example.com
	run

OUTPUT
	Structured result displaying resolved IP addresses, hostnames,
	subdomains, and discovered email addresses.

REQUIREMENTS
	theHarvester (optional, recommended); Python standard library socket
	library is used as automatic fallback.

AUTHOR
	Bhuvaneshkumar

VERSION
	Version 1.0